  "prefLabel": "Nur 102.04 Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 102.04 Quorum. Pursuant to RSA 91-A:2, I and RSA 21:15, II, a quorum for a meeting or hearing shall consist of a majority of members approved by the governor and council.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Nur 100) #5887, eff 8-26-94; ss by #6778, eff 6-26-98; ss by #7736, eff 8-6-02; ss by #8777, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10296, eff 3-22-13; ss by #10569, eff 4-17-14; ss by #12567, eff 6-29-18",
